## DLQ / retry
- Retry: `attempts × backoff`; on exhausted → DLQ.
- DLQ reprocessing: re-publish on the original subject after fix.

## Idempotency agreement
- Consumers must be re-runnable (same upstream result) — by `id` dedup.

